### Variáveis (ajuste o accountId para uma conta existente na sua fila)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accountId = 5b19c8b6-0cc4-4c72-a989-0c2ee15fa975

### Dica: pegue um accountId real consumindo a fila
# aws --endpoint-url=http://localhost:4566 --region sa-east-1 sqs receive-message \
#   --queue-url http://localhost:4566/000000000000/conta-bancaria-criada

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Crédito aprovado (200 SUCCEEDED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": { "value": 97.07, "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Débito aprovado (200 SUCCEEDED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": { "value": 10.00, "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Débito recusado por saldo insuficiente (422 FAILED, saldo intacto)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": { "value": 999999.99, "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Idempotência: repita este request 2x, mesma resposta e X-Idempotent-Replay: true
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/7e7ae808-b154-48b5-9f3e-553935cc4001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": { "value": 1.00, "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Conta inexistente (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": { "value": 10.00, "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Moeda não suportada (422 Problem Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": { "value": 10.00, "currency": "USD" }
}

### Payload inválido: valor com 3 casas decimais (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions/{{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": { "value": 1.005, "currency": "BRL" }
}

### Métricas do autorizador
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
